<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman starts Omnicare.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman starts Omnicare.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it initiated coverage of Omnicare Inc as a buy.</p>
<p>-- said Omnicare is a premier institutional pharmacy provider with a 25 percent sustainable growth rate.</p>
<p>-- Omnicare's stock closed Tuesday at 29-7/8.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
